# WITHERLEA: the size of the house matches the original's: 31 places (29
# rooms and the two parts of the hedges), 54 kinds of thing, 17 diary
# pages. Every room has a way out, every hotspot lies in the picture, each
# page lies in its own place, every thing has its own picture, every screen's
# words fit, and every tune's channels loop together.
game witherlea
wait 5
expect room_count == 31
expect item_kinds == 54
expect page_count == 17
expect rooms_bad == 0
expect art_bad == 0
expect layout_bad == 0
expect spot_count > 150
check_songs
expect jukebox_missing == 0
expect spot_count < 256
